{"meta":{"id":"array","category":"it/syntax/typescript/object","title":"배열 (Array) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"number[] · Array<number> · (string | number)[] · any[] 선언 방식과 readonly 배열","tags":["typescript","f-array"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">배열 (Array) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> number[] · Array&lt;number&gt; · (string | number)[] · any[] 선언 방식과 readonly 배열</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">선언 방식</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">선언 방식</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>number[]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">숫자 배열</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>string[]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열 배열</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>boolean[]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">불리언 배열</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Array&lt;number&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">숫자 배열, 제네릭 표기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>(string | number)[]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열 또는 숫자 배열</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>any[]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모든 타입을 허용하는 배열</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">사용 예</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const nums: number[] = [1, 2, 3];\r\nconst names: Array&lt;string&gt; = [&quot;kim&quot;, &quot;lee&quot;];\r\nconst mixed: (string | number)[] = [&quot;a&quot;, 1];\r\n\r\nconst users: User[] = [{ id: 1, name: &quot;kim&quot; }];   // 객체 배열\r\n\r\nnums.push(4);\r\n// nums.push(&quot;5&quot;);   // 오류: number[] 에 string 불가\r\n\r\nconst doubled = nums.map((n) =&gt; n * 2);   // number[] 로 추론</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>string | number[]</code> 는 \"문자열 또는 숫자 배열\" 이므로 요소 타입을 묶을 때는 괄호 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>(string | number)[]</code> 가 필요</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">읽기 전용 배열</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const fixed: readonly number[] = [1, 2, 3];\r\n// fixed.push(4);   // 오류\r\nconst fixed2: ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt; = [1, 2, 3];</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/object/array","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/typescript/object"}],"hasImage":false}